    {
        "id": "comment_header",
        "type": "comment",
        "z": "hbcm_dashboard_tab",
        "name": "HBCM Real-Time Dashboard - Phase 1 Implementation",
        "info": "This flow connects to the FastAPI backend WebSocket,\nparses HBCM simulation data, and displays it on a\nreal-time dashboard with control buttons.\n\n**Features:**\n- Real-time neural and cardiac monitoring\n- Gauges and time-series charts\n- Start/Stop/Pause/Reset controls\n- System status monitoring\n- Comfort index and phase drift metrics\n\n**Setup:**\n1. Ensure FastAPI backend is running on port 8000\n2. Deploy this flow\n3. Access dashboard at http://localhost:1880/ui\n4. Click Start to begin monitoring\n\n**Author:** Multi-Heart-Model Team\n**Date:** 2025-11-15",
        "x": 260,
        "y": 20,
        "wires": []
    }
